§2§lUndying Sentinels\n\n\
§0Zombies are a remarkable example of the Night Terror's influence. \
Their instinct driven relentlessness is a twisted reflection of humanity's endurance, both emotionally and physically. \
They gather in greater numbers after—"
data modify storage bittersweet:almanac book.pages append value "\
—repeated nights of troubled sleep, as all undead do. \
Furthermore, they get increasingly agitated as a chase drags out and their adrenalinal glands start to work once more. \
Shields are a great way to send a shock to their nerves as they ram full-force—"
data modify storage bittersweet:almanac book.pages append value "\
—into them, temporarily stunning them without having to take a hit yourself."
